---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Service schedule">
  <h1>Service schedule</h1>
  <p>The correct maintenance plan depends on market, engine, mileage, time, and operating conditions. Use the service schedule associated with the vehicle's VIN as the authority.</p>
  <h2>Maintenance log template</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Date and odometer</li>
    <li>Service performed</li>
    <li>Parts and consumables, including part numbers</li>
    <li>Specification/source used</li>
    <li>Shop or person performing the work</li>
    <li>Next due date or mileage, if specified</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
